Purpose: Match the requested unlit-room presentation while preserving actual
  cartridge play, native settings, checked saves and genuine power semantics.

Tasks:
- [x] Make the UI/room dark by default and construct a switchable physical lamp.
- [x] Add inverse-square spotlight shadows and finite authored wood bounce.
- [x] Attach one-sided, framebuffer-colored area illumination to the LCD.
- [x] Clear screen emission on power off without changing lamp state.
- [x] Add realistic material response and mapped mesh depression/rocking/hinges.
- [x] Bound idle shadows/readbacks and recover scheduling on software graphics.
- [x] Qualify real native input, persistence, shaders, controls and power.
