Acceptance criteria:
- Default room is dark; lamp and cartridge power operate independently.
- LCD illumination uses actual post-shader colors and follows its model pose.
- Physical power off destroys the runtime and extinguishes LCD area emission.
- Keyboard/remapped/pointer inputs move actual meshes and still reach the core.
- No gameplay buttons or toolbars cover the LCD.
- All normal build/browser publication gates pass; no assertions are skipped.
- Lighting approximations, technical evidence and human acceptance stay distinct.
- No private context, reference viewer assets or commercial ROM bytes are published.

