- 2026-11-04: Hosted software graphics exposed repeated readback starvation.
  Cache unchanged shadows/static sources, stop idle/modal backdrop paints,
  adapt backing resolution and leave recovery intervals after slow paints.
- 2026-11-04: Native PNG evidence exposed incomplete ROM startup and inputs
  ending before core polling. Wait for the real 8x8 demo frame and actual
  input/SRAM/pause responses instead of assuming wall-clock sleeps suffice.
- 2026-11-04: Preserve exact restored bytes in the newest resume slot instead
  of immediately recapturing a possibly stale native state. Keep exact native
  reload assertions; mutable automatic-slot comparisons cannot assume a real
  subsequent timer save has not occurred. Remapping tests isolate that timer.
- 2026-11-04: Final hosted release and live native verification succeeded.
  Windows CRLF checkout bytes differ from Pages' LF checkout; live comparison
